    FEAT-0002: keep bookings in a CSV file Facilities can open in a spreadsheet
    
    Facilities wants to open the bookings in a spreadsheet. CsvBookingStore
    is a second adapter for the same BookingStore port: a header row, then
    one row per booking. main.ts picks it instead of JsonBookingStore, and
    data/bookings.json became data/bookings.csv.
    
    CsvBookingStore.spec.ts runs the same contract as the other two stores,
    plus a test of the rows it writes. The e2e tests switched to the CSV
    store, since that's what yarn start uses now.
    
    Nothing in src/core changed, and neither did any core test. Compare
    FEAT-0001: a smaller change to the file's format changed every test.
    JsonBookingStore is still here, and still passes its own tests.

